Citrix Workspace app 26.04.10.1 for Linux, repackaged for personal use.

Citrix Workspace app is proprietary software. Use is governed by the Citrix
license agreement accepted in the application. This repackaging is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Citrix Systems, Inc.

The package contains the Citrix application payload together with the
compatibility changes needed to run it from a portable installation on
Wayland desktops. USB redirection is optional and is installed only when
explicitly requested with:

  citrix-workspace --install-usb
